Title: Automated Regulatory Change Monitoring and Compliance Update System

Inventor: [Your Name]
Filing Date: [Current Date]
Application Type: Provisional Patent Application

TECHNICAL FIELD

This invention relates to automated systems for monitoring regulatory changes and updating compliance frameworks, specifically implementing artificial intelligence and web monitoring technologies for real-time detection of regulatory modifications and automated compliance system updates.

BACKGROUND OF THE INVENTION

Organizations subject to regulatory oversight must continuously monitor changes to regulatory requirements, assess impact on their operations, and update their compliance systems accordingly. Manual monitoring of regulatory changes is resource-intensive, error-prone, and cannot scale across multiple regulatory jurisdictions and agencies.

Traditional regulatory monitoring relies on manual subscription to regulatory publications, periodic manual review of regulatory websites, and manual assessment of change impacts on existing compliance frameworks. This approach results in delayed awareness of regulatory changes, inconsistent compliance updates, and potential regulatory violations due to missed or misinterpreted changes.

Aviation organizations, for example, must monitor changes from FAA, EASA, Transport Canada, CASA Australia, and other regulatory authorities across multiple regulatory areas including training requirements, aircraft certification, and operational procedures. No existing system provides comprehensive automated monitoring with intelligent impact assessment and compliance system updates.

SUMMARY OF THE INVENTION

The present invention provides an automated regulatory change monitoring system that continuously monitors regulatory agency websites, detects changes to regulatory requirements, analyzes impact on existing compliance frameworks, and automatically updates compliance systems with new requirements.

The system utilizes web scraping, content analysis, artificial intelligence, and automated workflow management to provide real-time regulatory change detection with intelligent impact assessment and seamless compliance system integration.

Key innovations include:
- Automated multi-agency regulatory website monitoring and change detection
- AI-powered regulatory content analysis for change impact assessment
- Intelligent classification of regulatory changes by type, scope, and compliance impact
- Automated compliance framework updates with change tracking and audit trails
- Real-time notification and alert systems for critical regulatory changes

